WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.049 --> 00:00:04.710
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright is strictly

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:08.380
prohibited from posting classified information
on 4chan.

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:11.890
In fact, he should know by now that he’s
not allowed to go on 4chan using Foundation

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:16.400
computers, but he’s definitely not allowed
to release classified information on the forum.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:20.800
This includes but is not limited to: pictures
of containment cells and various anomalies,

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:25.480
such as pictures of SCP-682 with the caption
“Mondays, am I right?”

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:28.449
You are not right, this is not permitted.

00:00:28.449 --> 00:00:32.850
This also includes information about any anomalies
contained on-site, as well as any Foundation

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:33.850
personnel.

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:38.010
If Dr. Gears is microwaving fish in the breakroom,
then that complaint needs to be handled through

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:41.120
official channels rather than an unregulated
internet forum.

